      ":question/problem": "Simplify.\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\sin\\left(78^\\circ\\right)\\tan\\left(39^\\circ\\right)-1}{\\sin\\left(39^\\circ\\right)+\\cos\\left(39^\\circ\\right)}\n$$",
